<title>RUSSIA: TENNIS-KREMLIN CUP FOURTH DAY RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-KREMLIN CUP FOURTH DAY RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the $400,000 Kremlin</p>
<p>Cup womens' tennis tournament on Thursday:</p>
<p>Quarter-finals:</p>
<p>2-Barbara Paulus (Austria) beat Yelena Makarova (Russia) 6-2</p>
<p>5-7 6-0</p>
<p>1-Conchita Martinez (Spain) beat 8-Katerina Studenikova</p>
<p>(Slovakia) 6-3 6-1</p>
<p>7-Barbara Schett (Austria) beat Yelena Tatarkova (Ukraine)</p>
<p>6-0 6-2</p>
<p>4-Sabine Appelmans (Belgium) beat 5-Ruxandra Dragomir</p>
<p>(Romania) 6-1 6-3</p>
</text>
